  "method": {
    "source": "Independent minidom child traversal from five SHA-pinned English XML files; five separately pinned Latin files verify 740 sameAs targets and 558 identical citation labels. All 558 English paragraphs retain exact running text and actual xml:id. Every source-to-record slice and full paragraph restoration is compared, including 217 paragraphs with indentation before num.",
